# Vervato (PrimevalSummoner): a character in no party asks him to summon a corpse. With no dead
# party member on the isle there is no body: vervato002.htm, and no adena is taken. A scenario
# seeds no party and no dead player, and its NPCs stand in no npcmaker territory (the isle), so
# the paid summon, the fee taken twice during a summon (vervato005.htm), the Corpse Revival
# cast, the body brought to Vervato, the closing page (vervato004.htm) and the isle territory
# check are in primeval_summoner_test.go.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (PrimevalSummoner.onTalk).
character Loner 20
script script.teleport.PrimevalSummoner
item 57
page default/32104.htm
page script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/
npc vervato 32104 Folk 10 0 0

action vervato
action vervato
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=default/32104.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{vervato}_Quest PrimevalSummoner
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=vervato item=0 page=script/teleport/PrimevalSummoner/vervato002.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
  items 57=0
